# Quest book (design/quests/*.toml → tools/gen_quests.py → pack/config/ftbquests/quests/) and the Life 1 extras
# in kubejs/server_scripts/ttl/quests/. `ttl quests ...` prints "ttl: ..." on any failure, which
# `server.sh test-all` counts as a failure.
# Expect in the log: no "[ttl] quests" errors; the bot hears "One day and one night." once.
# 1. Every generated chapter and quest is loaded by FTB Quests.
ttl quests check
# 2. A fresh Life 1 gets the Wayfarer's Primer and no backlog of whispers.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotQuests
# A bot left over from an earlier run may already be past Life 1: start it fresh.
ttl reset TtlBotQuests
@sleep 8
ttl quests tick TtlBotQuests
ttl quests expect TtlBotQuests primer yes
# 3. Surviving the first day earns exactly one whisper.
ttl karma TtlBotQuests set play_time 24000
ttl quests tick TtlBotQuests
ttl quests expect TtlBotQuests said day1
# 4. FTB Quests accepts the bot: complete and reset the first quest ("Only Once", id from generated/quests.js).
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotQuests complete 50382544FBB449E8
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotQuests reset 50382544FBB449E8
ttlbot remove TtlBotQuests
# 5. Story chapters 7 (Crossroads) and 8 (The King's Test): tools/gen_quests.py story extensions in use (design/quests.md, WP-S6).
# `ttl quests check` above already proves that every chapter-7/8 quest loaded, including the cross-chapter `deps`
# (FTB Quests drops an unresolved dependency silently, so a quest missing from the check is the symptom).
# There is no command that claims a reward or reads quest visibility, so the flows below do what the book does: complete the quest
# through FTB (`ftbquests change_progress`, which auto-claims the invisible rewards: the honour flag) and run the claimed command
# reward as the bot (`ttl story oath|act|fight`, the same commands the reward lines run). NOT asserted here, verify in game:
# a dark soul never sees the light lane (and the reverse), the Oath menu opens from the Crossroads reward, a party shares the lane.
# ids are from generated/quests.js: crossroads/crossroads 3D14EC5F5890B8B5, kings_test/honour_terms 5CE177F176862D46,
# kings_test/regicide 6A02570FD1A84087, kings_test/act_two 6DDF459E16D36563.
# L: the light lane. The Oath (the Crossroads reward), then "Terms of Honour" sets honour_duel by itself, the kill then costs nothing.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotLaneL
ttlbot spawn TtlBotLaneD
@sleep 2
ttl reset TtlBotLaneL
ttl reset TtlBotLaneD
kubejs stages add TtlBotLaneL ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotLaneD ttl.life2
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotLaneL reset 3D14EC5F5890B8B5
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotLaneL reset 5CE177F176862D46
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotLaneD reset 3D14EC5F5890B8B5
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotLaneD reset 6A02570FD1A84087
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotLaneL complete 3D14EC5F5890B8B5
execute as TtlBotLaneL run ttl story oath light
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneL path light
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneL stage ttl.path.light yes
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneL stage ttl.story.act1 yes
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneL flag honour_duel no
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotLaneL complete 5CE177F176862D46
@sleep 2
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneL flag honour_duel yes
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneL stage ttl.story.honour_duel yes
ttl story killrep TtlBotLaneL gazel_dwargo
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneL flag honour_duel no
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneL flag regicide no
ttl rep expect TtlBotLaneL dwargon value 0
ttl story act TtlBotLaneL 2
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneL act 2 yes
ttl rep expect TtlBotLaneL dwargon value 15
# D: the dark lane. Regicide (no honour flag): Dwargon -60 and the flag, then Act II by the finale's reward (-20 more, Outcast +10).
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotLaneD complete 3D14EC5F5890B8B5
execute as TtlBotLaneD run ttl story oath dark
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneD path dark
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneD stage ttl.path.dark yes
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneD flag honour_duel no
ttl story killrep TtlBotLaneD gazel_dwargo
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneD flag regicide yes
ttl rep expect TtlBotLaneD dwargon value -60
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotLaneD complete 6A02570FD1A84087
ttl story act TtlBotLaneD 2
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneD act 2 yes
ttl rep expect TtlBotLaneD dwargon value -80
ttl story expect TtlBotLaneD flag honour_duel no
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotLaneL reset 3D14EC5F5890B8B5
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotLaneL reset 5CE177F176862D46
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotLaneD reset 3D14EC5F5890B8B5
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotLaneD reset 6A02570FD1A84087
ttl reset TtlBotLaneL
ttl reset TtlBotLaneD
ttlbot remove TtlBotLaneL
ttlbot remove TtlBotLaneD
# 6. Story chapters 9 (Two Hundred Thousand, Act III) and 10 (The Whirlpool, Act IV): both lanes end to end (WP-S7, design/quests.md).
# Like section 5: a quest is completed through FTB (`ftbquests change_progress`; the invisible command rewards run: the lane flags), the
# claimed command rewards run as the bot (`ttl story act|fight`). `ttl quests check` above already proves every chapter-9/10 quest
# loaded, including the cross-chapter `deps` on kings_test/act_two and orc_lord/hold_the_line + ep_10000 (an unresolved dependency is
# dropped silently by FTB Quests, so a quest missing from the check is the symptom). NOT asserted here, verify in game: a dark soul
# never sees the light lane (and the reverse), the fight-start claims from the camp / the lake shore (the radius-40 and radius-60
# locations and the 96-block rule of `ttl story fight`), the hand-ins, that Milim's domain location matches the placed build.
# ids are from generated/quests.js: two_hundred_thousand/spare_orcs 26F513965BD87791, devour_king 71484AC8A112CDDE,
# whirlpool/wake_calamity 59F4870034DD1420.
# L: the light lane. Oath, Act II, "Spare the Orcs" (flag orcs_joined), Act III (lizardmen +20, tempest +10), Act IV (tempest +15).
ttlbot spawn TtlBotWarL
ttlbot spawn TtlBotWarD
@sleep 2
ttl reset TtlBotWarL
ttl reset TtlBotWarD
kubejs stages add TtlBotWarL ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotWarD ttl.life2
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotWarL reset 26F513965BD87791
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotWarL reset 71484AC8A112CDDE
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotWarL reset 59F4870034DD1420
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotWarD reset 26F513965BD87791
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotWarD reset 71484AC8A112CDDE
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotWarD reset 59F4870034DD1420
execute as TtlBotWarL run ttl story oath light
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL path light
ttl story act TtlBotWarL 2
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL flag orcs_joined no
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotWarL complete 26F513965BD87791
@sleep 2
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL flag orcs_joined yes
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL stage ttl.story.orcs_joined yes
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL flag horde_leader no
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL act 3 no
ttl story act TtlBotWarL 3
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL act 3 yes
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL stage ttl.story.act3 yes
ttl rep expect TtlBotWarL lizardmen value 20
ttl rep expect TtlBotWarL tempest value 30
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL unlocked orc_lord yes
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL unlocked orc_disaster yes
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL act 4 no
ttl story act TtlBotWarL 4
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL act 4 yes
ttl rep expect TtlBotWarL tempest value 45
ttl story expect TtlBotWarL unlocked charybdis yes
# L: the Disaster answers only a soul that beat the Orc Lord (its `requires`); the story fight starts both bosses from anywhere for ops.
ttl boss cooldown clear all
ttl boss expect TtlBotWarL gate orc_disaster no
kubejs stages add TtlBotWarL ttl.defeated.orc_lord
ttl boss expect TtlBotWarL gate orc_disaster yes
ttl boss expect TtlBotWarL gate charybdis yes
ttl story fight orc_disaster TtlBotWarL
@sleep 3
ttl boss expect TtlBotWarL active orc_disaster yes
ttl boss abort orc_disaster
ttl story fight charybdis TtlBotWarL
@sleep 3
ttl boss expect TtlBotWarL active charybdis yes
ttl boss abort charybdis
@sleep 1
ttl boss expect TtlBotWarL active orc_disaster no
ttl boss expect TtlBotWarL active charybdis no
ttl boss cooldown clear all
# D: the dark lane. "Devour the King" (flag horde_leader), "Wake the Calamity" (flag charybdis_woke), Act III (orc_horde +40 on top of the
# Oath's 15, lizardmen -20), Act IV (outcast +20 on top of 20 + 10).
execute as TtlBotWarD run ttl story oath dark
ttl story expect TtlBotWarD path dark
ttl story act TtlBotWarD 2
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotWarD complete 71484AC8A112CDDE
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotWarD complete 59F4870034DD1420
@sleep 2
ttl story expect TtlBotWarD flag horde_leader yes
ttl story expect TtlBotWarD stage ttl.story.horde_leader yes
ttl story expect TtlBotWarD flag charybdis_woke yes
ttl story expect TtlBotWarD flag orcs_joined no
ttl story act TtlBotWarD 3
ttl story expect TtlBotWarD act 3 yes
ttl rep expect TtlBotWarD orc_horde value 55
ttl rep expect TtlBotWarD lizardmen value -20
ttl story act TtlBotWarD 4
ttl story expect TtlBotWarD act 4 yes
ttl rep expect TtlBotWarD outcast value 50
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotWarL reset 26F513965BD87791
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotWarD reset 71484AC8A112CDDE
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotWarD reset 59F4870034DD1420
ttl reset TtlBotWarL
ttl reset TtlBotWarD
ttlbot remove TtlBotWarL
ttlbot remove TtlBotWarD
